tooltip.rsaudio.dmr_core.3=At the end of a meltdown it implodes and leaves a crater
tooltip.rsaudio.dmr_core.4=A spinning plasma orb hangs in the chamber, wrapped by two counter-rotating confinement rings; it convulses during a meltdown

